  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 513.05 Approval Criteria for Accessory Docking Structures",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 513.05 Approval Criteria for Accessory Docking Structures. In addition to the criteria and requirements established for docking structures, the construction, installation, or modification of an accessory docking structure, whether an anchoring pad for a seasonal docking structure, canopy, dolphin, ice cluster, tie-off piling, wave attenuator, or watercraft lift, shall comply with the applicable provisions of this part relative to design and construction standards for specific types of accessory docking structures.\n\nSource. #12805, eff 12-15-19; ss by #13124, eff 10-23-20; ss by #13776, eff 10-13-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt500.html"
